        "reasoning": "Before the change, the cart held Mug Today is a good day at quantity 1 (obs 3) plus a Hummingbird cushion at quantity 1 (obs 4). These two adds look like the setup that filled the cart. After loading the cart page, a POST to cart?update=1&id_product=8 with op=up and qty=2 got a success response showing quantity 3 and a total of €35.70 (obs 5, obs 6). The final cart probe confirms the mug is at quantity 3 and the cushion is still at 1 (obs 1). No other lines were changed."
       }
      ]
